  "**Grid** Show the layer grid. In supported layer types, hiding the grid will also allow free positioning of elements.": "**网格** 显示图层网格。部分图层类型支持在隐藏网格后自由放置元素。",
  "**Render auto-layers** Enable or disable the rendering of tiles in all Auto-Layers. If disabled, only the underlying IntGrid values will be displayed.": "**渲染自动图层** 控制是否渲染所有自动图层中的图块。关闭后仅显示原始整数网格值。",
  "**Select empty spaces** If this option is enabled when you select a level area with ALT+SHIFT+click, the selection will also include EMPTY grid cells.": "**选中空白格** 开启后，使用 Alt + Shift + 点击框选关卡区域时，也会选中空白网格单元。",
  "**Show/hide details** When enabled, shows all elements in layers (tiles, entities, intGrid etc.), or only tiles otherwise.": "**显示或隐藏细节** 开启后显示所有图层元素（图块、实体、整数网格等），关闭后仅显示图块。",
  "**Show/hide enum tags** When enabled, shows a color overlay on tiles that have an Enum tag attached to them (see the Tilesets panel to tag tiles using Enums).\\nOnly applies to Tiles layers and Auto-layers.": "**显示或隐藏枚举标签** 开启后，带有枚举标签的图块会显示颜色标记。可在图块集面板中给图块添加标签。\\n仅适用于图块图层和自动图层。",
  "**Single layer mode** Enable this to fade all other layers, and focus on active layer only. NOTE: this will also affect the Selection tool (ALT+click).": "**单图层模式** 开启后会淡化其他图层，便于专注于当前图层。这也会影响选择工具（Alt + 点击）。",
  "**Tile stacking** Only applies to Tiles layers. If this option is enabled, you will be able to stack multiple tiles in a single grid cell.": "**图块堆叠** 开启后，可在同一网格单元放置多个图块。仅适用于图块图层。",
  "**Zen mode** This mode automatically hides the left panel to give more editing space.": "**专注模式** 自动隐藏左侧面板，腾出更多编辑空间。",
